<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places three credits in money mart.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places three credits in money mart.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed all three credit auctions on the secondary market on Friday, and thus injected a total of 4.399 billion pesos.</p>
<p>   CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE</p>
<p>1.699 bln pesos  12 days  25.70</p>
<p>1.700 bln pesos  11 days  25.49</p>
<p>   1.000 bln pesos   3 days  24.66</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
